1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,070
(Sheldon:)You own a smoking monkey?

2
00:00:02,070 --> 00:00:04,020
(Amy:)Don't be silly.
He's one of the animals

3
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:06,170
(Amy:)in my department's
nicotine addiction study.

4
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,670
(Sheldon:)What's he doing here?

5
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:10,970
(Amy:)I'm giving him emphysema.

6
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:14,140
(Amy:)The least I can do is let him
hang out and watch cable.

7
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,410
(Sheldon:)Remarkable.

8
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,450
(Sheldon:)Aren't you worried
about secondhand smoke?

9
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:22,850
(Penny:)A little.
The real danger is him biting

10
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:24,660
(Amy:)my face off while I'm sleeping.

11
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:31,050
(Sheldon:)Is he deliberately
blowing smoke at me?

12
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:34,130
(Amy:)Yeah. He's kind of an ass.

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:39,040
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

14
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:41,840
(Sheldon:)May I share
something with you

15
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,310
(Sheldon:)that's troubling me?

16
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:44,730
(Amy:)Of course.

17
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:46,810
(Amy:)What's rattling around that
big bulbous head of yours?

18
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:49,650
(Sheldon:)Priya has essentially nullified

19
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,550
(Sheldon:)my roommate agreement
with Leonard,

20
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:55,320
(Sheldon:)making life in the apartment
very uncomfortable for me.

21
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:58,690
(Amy:)And you want me
to kill her? Done.

